          "why_it_matters": "This is a strong snapshot of where the younger Japanese jazz thread is heading. Ishiwaka, Takahashi and Holoubek bring the new trio's first hall tour to its published closing date with Tomoaki Baba, turning Mabui's all-Ishiwaka book into a four-way conversation shaped by a shared Terumasa Hino lineage. The setup has real instrumental character—drums, acoustic and electric keys with electronics, bass and tenor sax—and the ALFIE connection in the trio's first record makes the project especially legible inside Listening Notes without making that connection the reason for admission.",
